# Mapbox public token, for the terrain image behind the trail map.
#
# Optional. With no token the trail map falls back to the drawn version on a
# dark green panel and everything else works unchanged.
#
# Make one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ and restrict it to your
# domains. The free tier covers 50,000 static image requests a month; this app
# uses roughly one per trail per device per month.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
